WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.828 --> 00:00:02.085
SCOTT LANG
It's okay. Breathe.

00:00:02.135 --> 00:00:03.562
[Breathing]

00:00:04.016 --> 00:00:05.047
SCOTT LANG
We're gonna get out of this.

00:00:05.097 --> 00:00:06.551
[Breathing]

00:00:06.601 --> 00:00:07.324
SCOTT LANG
And we're gonna go home.

00:00:07.491 --> 00:00:09.027
[Breathing]

00:00:13.951 --> 00:00:14.573
KANG THE CONQUEROR
This place...

00:00:15.774 --> 00:00:17.267
...it isn't what you think.

00:00:19.236 --> 00:00:20.437
It's a cage.

00:00:22.321 --> 00:00:23.123
But we can help each other.

00:00:28.932 --> 00:00:30.197
JANET VAN DYNE
He is a monster.

00:00:30.431 --> 00:00:31.845
You cannot trust him.

00:00:33.237 --> 00:00:34.216
KANG THE CONQUEROR
I'm just a man...

00:00:37.093 --> 00:00:38.021
...but know how it ends.

00:00:41.240 --> 00:00:42.376
SCOTT LANG
I don't care what he can do.

00:00:42.975 --> 00:00:43.677
He is not getting out!

00:00:47.257 --> 00:00:48.198
KANG THE CONQUEROR
You thought you could win.

00:00:49.299 --> 00:00:50.342
[Screaming]

00:00:50.892 --> 00:00:51.897
SCOTT LANG
I don't have to win.

00:00:51.959 --> 00:00:53.671
We both just have to lose.

00:00:53.833 --> 00:00:54.771
[Screaming]

